{"ID":"20240515131406-puxm61f","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240515131406-puxm61f","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515131406-puxm61f\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515141342-gwvdsh4\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515141342-gwvdsh4\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:100,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515141342-gwvdsh4\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:345,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:345\u0026#125;","title":"071","type":"doc","updated":"20240515171618"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240515141342-gwvdsh4","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"width: 924px;","id":"20240515141342-gwvdsh4","updated":"20240515171618"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪醫師病案紀錄"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 初診日期：2008/08/06"}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"姓名"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"LM"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性別："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"男"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"年齡及體型"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"35 中等"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診日期："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2008/08/06"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診原因：呼吸急促，心悸，後背頸項痠，睡不沉，思慮重"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診：\n睡不沉，思慮重。\n小便一日二、三次，但量多，有汗。\n飯後打嗝，腸鳴，屁多。\n體力中等，無關節痠痛。\n無口渴，喜冷飲\n胃口好\n大便每日行\n雙足溫"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脈診：脈沉緩無力-\u0026gt;夏逢冬脈"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"望診：\n1、舌診：淡白紅 \n2、眼診 : 瞳孔反應不快，肝區太平整。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"耳診："}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"診斷： 腎陰陽皆虛，治腎必治心"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"針灸處方： 委中，陰谷，天柱，大杼"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中藥處方：\n黃連兩銭，黃芩三銭，阿膠三錢(分三包烊盡)，白芍四錢，炮附子四錢，\n熟地三錢，澤瀉五錢，半夏三錢，粳米三錢，厚朴兩銭，代赭石三錢，\n生薑兩片，補骨脂三錢，桂枝四錢，炙甘草三錢，訶黎勒兩銭。\n拾付，\n九碗煮三碗，\n早晚飯前服。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"解說："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"天柱會痠痛多為久病，腎陽不好。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"備註："}]}]}]}]}